{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o197","title":"郡功曹游殷察异儿童之张既，引过其家待以宾馔","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-7a1f6b65012cde962f44","label":"裴注·三辅决录注","text":"郡功曹游殷察异儿童之张既，引过其家待以宾馔","evidence":["liusima-q-4719956bf0db1248c803"]},{"id":"liusima-a-1d79cfdf393b3fcd0df3","label":"裴注·三辅决录注","text":"游殷与张既论霸王之略，飨讫以子楚托之","evidence":["liusima-q-739541238baa7061f7bd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0046","role":"郡功曹，察异之，引既过家，先归敕家具设宾馔，答妻之笑曰卿勿怪，乃方伯之器也；与既论霸王之略，飨讫以子楚托之，固托之","evidence":["liusima-q-4719956bf0db1248c803","liusima-q-739541238baa7061f7bd"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"为儿童，被游殷察异，敬诺过其家；以殷邦之宿望难违其旨，乃许之","evidence":["liusima-q-4719956bf0db1248c803","liusima-q-739541238baa7061f7bd"]},{"person":"liusima-p0045","role":"被父游殷托于张既","evidence":["liusima-q-739541238baa7061f7bd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-4719956bf0db1248c803","liusima-q-739541238baa7061f7bd"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-4719956bf0db1248c803","source_order":[15,159,13],"order":3297}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0045","name":"游楚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liusima-p0046","name":"游殷","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0068","name":"张既","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-4719956bf0db1248c803","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-473bdeabf9a9e3929915","layer":"pei","quote":"既为儿童，为郡功曹游殷察异之。引既过家，既敬诺。殷先归，敕家具设宾馔。及既至，殷妻笑曰：‘君其悖乎？张德容，童昏小儿，何异客哉！’殷曰：‘卿勿怪，乃方伯之器也","attribution":"裴注·三辅决录注","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4feaf9d5c7378b57140d","start":13,"end":92},{"id":"liusima-q-739541238baa7061f7bd","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-473bdeabf9a9e3929915","layer":"pei","quote":"殷遂与既论霸王之略。飨讫，以子楚，托之；既谦不受，殷固托之。既以殷邦之宿望，难违其旨，乃许之","attribution":"裴注·三辅决录注","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml",